{"availability":"available","full":"chapmangj/geoinsights3d","name":"geoinsights3d","description":"⛏️ Open-source Python tool for rapid 3D visualisation, automated modelling, and AI-powered analysis of geological drilling data.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2025-07-08T04:13:36Z","updated":"2025-08-26T04:52:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://geoinsights3d.streamlit.app/","topics":["geology","geoscience","mineral-exploration"],"demo":"https://geoinsights3d.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T21:34:04.857Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T21:34:04.857Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T21:34:04.857Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:23.493Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T21:34:04.857Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:16.225Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["GeoInsights 3D is an open-source Python application designed to accelerate the exploratory data analysis (EDA) workflow for geologists and data scientists working with drilling data."],"features":["Data Ingestion and Preparation: The software directly handles common drilling data formats and includes a length-weighted compositing tool to standardize sample intervals, a critical prerequisite for reliable…","Statistical Analysis: The application provides rapid generation of key statistical summaries, including descriptive statistics tables, histograms, and box plots. This allows for immediate quantitative assessment of data…","Interactive Visualisation and Spatial Analysis: The core of the application is a 3D viewer for drillhole data. Users can dynamically filter by grade or lithology and apply vertical exaggeration. The software also…","Automated 3D Modeling: To overcome the time-consuming nature of manual interpretation, the software includes automated tools for creating 3D grade shells. It uses Principal Component Analysis (PCA) to determine the…","Geochemical Domain Modeling: The software implements PCA and K-Means clustering to define geological domains objectively from geochemical data. This provides a repeatable method to group samples with similar properties,…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapmangj/geoinsights3d/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"fc76d8927ce432bdbe332f85ab7785d57c0f99b39c5d911bdf435b4d06a3f08f","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:15:27.988Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:16.220Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-08-26T04:52:02Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"GeoInsights 3D is an open-source Python application designed to accelerate the exploratory data analysis (EDA) workflow for geologists and data scientists working with drilling data.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapmangj/geoinsights3d/blob/main/readme.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Set up API Key (Optional for AI features):","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapmangj/geoinsights3d/blob/main/readme.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The generative AI features require a Google Gemini API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapmangj/geoinsights3d/blob/main/readme.md"}],"fingerprint":"fc76d8927ce432bdbe332f85ab7785d57c0f99b39c5d911bdf435b4d06a3f08f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapmangj/geoinsights3d/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:16.220Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapmangj/geoinsights3d/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:16.221Z","hash":"fc76d8927ce432bdbe332f85ab7785d57c0f99b39c5d911bdf435b4d06a3f08f","originalBytes":4951,"storedBytes":4951,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","application","key","venv","analysis","api","geochemical","install","software","data.","features","geoinsights","geological","models","activate","automated","bash","control","create","environment","google","pip","project","provides","python","